{
  "info": {
    "name": "ZeroTouch Hito 2 — recorrido local",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Ejecutar en Collection Runner, en orden, sobre una base de demostración. Genera una cuenta ficticia por ejecución (no hay DELETE de usuarios). Cookie jar habilitado. Variables de contraseña/CSRF solo locales al recorrido; no exportarlas. Para motor: ejecutar hasta 18 y guardar solamente el cuerpo data de esa respuesta como motor-local/config.local.json. El recorrido completo borra perfil y modo. Persistencia: usar la prueba integration/collection.test.js o detener entre 18 y 19, reiniciar servidor y repetir 13. No utiliza React."
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 Salud",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/health"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 Registro ficticio",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/registro",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\"nombre_usuario\":\"{{usuario}}\",\"contrasena\":\"{{contrasena}}\"}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.variables.set(\"usuario\", \"demo_\" + pm.variables.replaceIn(\"{{$guid}}\").replace(/-/g, \"\").slice(0, 24));",
              "pm.variables.set(\"contrasena\", pm.variables.replaceIn(\"{{$guid}}\") + \"!Aa\");"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 201\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 Login",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\"nombre_usuario\":\"{{usuario}}\",\"contrasena\":\"{{contrasena}}\"}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.variables.set(\"csrf_token\", pm.response.json().data.csrf_token);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 Sesión",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/sesion"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "05 Crear perfil",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-CSRF-Token",
            "value": "{{csrf_token}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/perfiles",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\"nombre\":\"Demo Hito 2\"}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 201\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "pm.variables.set(\"perfil_id\", pm.response.json().data.id);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "06 Listar perfiles",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/perfiles?limite=20&offset=0"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "07 Leer perfil",
      "request": {
